mapping "V5668.1" source="V5668" target="271579008" relationship=partial_overlap {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V5668 = Swedish 7-char extension of ICD-10 V56.6 (passenger of pick-up truck/van,
        collision with nonmotor vehicle, traffic accident) further specified by activity SNOMED CT
        271579008 (other specified activities). Parent V56.6 crosswalks to SNOMED CT 4152175 (Motor vehicle
        on road in collision with nonmotor vehicle, concept_code 271579008). Target captures the
        accident/injury component (vehicle type, collision partner, traffic status, occupant role) but
        drops the activity-context component, which has no single standard SNOMED CT concept for. Partial
        (multi-axis source). Moderate confidence: crosswalk inherited from parent V56.6, not
        independently re-verified at the Swedish-extension level.
        """
}
